From: mkinney <2219838+mkinney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:49:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): clip pick outlines before screen projection

Clip selected and hover outline segments against the renderer near plane
and positive w before the perspective divide. Preserve adjacent visible
runs and closed seams. Add seven projection and stroke regression pins.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3024
